{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792680830, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "tmux-256color"}}
[0.008259, "o", "## Board: PolarFire SoC Icicle Kit (MPFS250T), VectorBlox V250 NPU in fabric, Linux on the RISC-V U54 cores\r\n   $ ssh icicle-kit 'uname -m; uptime; cat /sys/class/uio/uio*/name'\r\n"]
[0.7804, "o", "   riscv64\r\n"]
[0.790673, "o", "    14:53:50 up 3 min,  0 user,  load average: 0.10, 0.14, 0.06\r\n"]
[0.799455, "o", "   fpga_lsram dma-controller@60010000 vbx@60030000 \r\n"]
[12.803839, "o", "\r\n## Input: 512 replayed SYNTHETIC ODMR spectra (input.int8.npy). Not a live sensor. Same bytes as the 2026-10-14 run.\r\n   $ sha256sum model.vnnx input.int8.npy\r\n"]
[12.805425, "o", "   55bf88b72725c7b252ab48107436cd31427fb86da81a207fc19ab0afad06f5b9  model.vnnx\r\n   f774fa0e603c43ebdb22d1423bb6248751a7b2bf2aa1d3c6fdc1fc2b22768434  input.int8.npy\r\n"]
[24.808282, "o", "\r\n## Run the published INT8 model on the kit (pfkit copies the runner, model and input, runs vbx_run, copies hw.bin back)\r\n   $ pfkit infer model.vnnx --input input.int8.npy --output runs/20261022-105350/hw.bin --json runs/20261022-105350/hw.json --runner ./vbx_run --config kit.yaml\r\n"]
[29.785418, "o", "   ssh icicle-kit 'mkdir -p /tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b'\r\n   scp vbx_run model.vnnx input.int8.bin icicle-kit:/tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/\r\n   ssh icicle-kit '/tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/vbx_run --model /tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/model.vnnx --input /tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/input.int8.bin --output /tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/hw.bin --timeout-ms 5000 --json /tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/hw.json'\r\n   scp icicle-kit:/tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/hw.bin runs/20261022-105350/hw.bin\r\n   scp icicle-kit:/tmp/pfkit/manual-20261022-145415-4833b82b/hw.json runs/20261022-105350/hw.json\r\n"]
[29.802075, "o", "   kit reported: completed 512/512, npu_error 0, median 0.037999 ms per sample\r\n"]
[43.805073, "o", "\r\n## Compare: fresh kit output vs published kit output (2026-10-14) vs CPU INT8 simulation\r\n   $ python3 compare.py runs/20261022-105350/hw.bin published/hw.bin published/sim.npz\r\n"]
[43.896801, "o", "rows: fresh kit 512, published kit 512, CPU INT8 simulation 512 (key 'outputs')\r\nfresh kit  == published kit : 512/512 rows identical; sha256 EQUAL\r\nfresh kit  == CPU INT8 sim  : 512/512 rows identical\r\nsha256 fresh     080474358d3a1efeacc89cc946821e7e8446db266f84fa433cdbc0598748ec90\r\nsha256 published 080474358d3a1efeacc89cc946821e7e8446db266f84fa433cdbc0598748ec90\r\n\r\nESTABLISHES: the published INT8 model runs on the kit's V250 NPU and returns the same 512 INT8 outputs as the\r\n             CPU INT8 reference, on these replayed SYNTHETIC inputs. Conversion and on-kit inference path work.\r\nDOES NOT ESTABLISH: sensing. No live diamond, no measured spectra, no accuracy claim (final-field error on this\r\n             set was 14.47 uT, worse than a 12.6 uT constant), no full control-loop timing.\r\nRESULT: MATCH\r\n"]
[61.912803, "o", "\r\n— end of demonstration —\r\n"]
